# S5-07 current CPU0 ACPI N=2 with per-run execution sidecars

Date: 2026-11-16

## Purpose

Rerun the strict unique-nonce automatic N=2 series on the current CPU0 ACPI
fixture with the new opt-in per-run execution-observations sidecars. The
sidecars localize RDTSC-site and delivered page-fault differences; they do not
change marker validation, the comparator, or acceptance criteria.

