## Conclusion

The opt-in series sidecar path worked on both runs and captured complete bounded
event records. This unique-nonce N=2 is not accepted: run 0001 failed strict
marker validation, the automatic comparison failed, and RDTSC/#PF variations
remain unexplained. The marker interleaving recurred; no parser relaxation or
volatile-field normalization was made. S5-07 remains blocked/unaccepted.
